  "description": "FPDF-based PDF generator for .NET. Embeds TrueType fonts with valid PDF descriptors (Acrobat-strict compatible), draws text / lines / rectangles / cells / multi-cell / images, and exposes the classic FPDF API on net8.0 and net9.0. Pair with EgoPDF.Barcodes to render Zebra ZPL II labels.",
  "id": "EgoPDF.Generator",
